Package: keel-overlay-wireguard
Architecture: all
Depends:
 keel (>= 0.12.0),
 wireguard-tools (>= 1.0.20210914),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Keel overlay: WireGuard, the mesh
 The WireGuard overlay of Keel Linux (handbook decisions 0024 and 0036):
 trixie's wireguard-tools, and the overlay manifest keel reads, installed
 as /usr/share/keel/overlays/wireguard.yaml (decision 0041).
 .
 The overlay declares no process: the interface, its wg-quick unit, its
 address and its port are each machine's choice, kept in the instance spec
 and converged by keel spec apply. Installing this package enables
 nothing.
